 are putting our lives on the line to get the change we need now. #BlackLivesMatter","userId":67635390,"media":null,"username":"TVWatchtower","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":55,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":7.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1269689126183288834,"date":1591552452000,"rawContent":"Damn right it is worth the risk. Enough is enough. #DefundthePolice #AbolishThePolice #BlackLivesMatter #GeorgeFloyd","userId":67635390,"media":null,"username":"TVWatchtower","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":8,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":55,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1274578623840706560,"date":1592718199000,"rawContent":"The #BlackLivesMatter protests have different themes and involve so many creative ways to express their ideas. Each day is something new. Just love how inventive and creative they are: art, music, dance, sports, videos, songs, using old statutes to project new images. Amazing.","userId":67635390,"media":null,"username":"TVWatchtower","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":9,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":55,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":9.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1274579207830429696,"date":1592718338000,"rawContent":"I find it impressive that the #BlackLivesMatter demonstrations express ideas in new ways. So artful and beautiful. They gather to protest 